{"html":"<h2 id=\"banner-grabbing\">Banner Grabbing</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I &lt;domain_name/IP&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Reveals server info and other stuff.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>OR</strong></p>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code>nikto -h &lt;domain_name/IP&gt; -Tuning b\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Reveals other hidden directories and information like <code>robots.txt</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"banner-grabbing","title":"Banner Grabbing","level":2}]}